  "story": {
    "title": "Outer Space",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "One day some strange flying creatures appear above the Earth. \"Look!\" - says Anthony - \"What curious flying insects!\". \"I'm ready to travel in the outer space!\" - says Mary. Wow!!!",
      "\"Wait!\" - says David - \"Before going I want to take a photo\". Clic! Clic! Clic!",
      "Mary begins to dream about an exciting trip. I'm coming!",
      "\"Ok! All is ready! Let's start! - says Anthony. Three - two - one - GOOOOO!!!!!! After some minutes they are in the Space.",
      "During the rocket trip they experience floating in the space. \"Amazing!\" - says David.",
      "In the end they land on a brown planet. \"Someone is waiting for us!\" - says Anthony. \"Let's go out and greet the alien!\" - says David.",
      "In the brown planet there isn't day but only night. \"Stars everywhere!\" - exclaims Mary. \"I want to live here!\".",
      "But time is over. \"We must come back home! - says Anthony. They greet the disconsolate alien and then fly away back home.",
      "\"What a wonderful trip!\" - says Mary. \"And how beautiful is our Earth!\" - says David."
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "One day some strange flying creatures appear above the Earth.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Một ngày nọ, vài sinh vật bay lạ xuất hiện trên Trái Đất."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"Look!\" - says Anthony - \"What curious flying insects!\".",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Nhìn kìa!\" - Anthony nói - \"Thật là những con côn trùng bay lạ!\"."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"I'm ready to travel in the outer space!\" - says Mary. Wow!!!",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Tớ sẵn sàng đi du hành ngoài không gian rồi!\" - Mary nói. Chà chà!!!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"Wait!\" - says David - \"Before going I want to take a photo\".",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Đợi đã!\" - David nói - \"Trước khi đi tớ muốn chụp một tấm ảnh\"."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Clic! Clic! Clic!",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Clic! Clic! Clic!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Mary begins to dream about an exciting trip. I'm coming!",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mary bắt đầu mơ về một chuyến đi thú vị. Tớ đến đây!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"Ok! All is ready!",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Được rồi! Mọi thứ đã sẵn sàng!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Let's start! - says Anthony.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng ta bắt đầu thôi!\" - Anthony nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Three - two - one - GOOOOO!!!!!!",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ba - hai - một - ĐIIIIIIIIII!!!!!!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "After some minutes they are in the Space.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sau vài phút, họ đã ở trong Không gian."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "During the rocket trip they experience floating in the space.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Trong chuyến đi tên lửa, họ trải nghiệm cảm giác lơ lửng trong không gian."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"Amazing!\" - says David.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Tuyệt vời quá!\" - David nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "In the end they land on a brown planet.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cuối cùng, họ hạ cánh xuống một hành tinh màu nâu."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"Someone is waiting for us!\" - says Anthony.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Có ai đó đang đợi chúng ta!\" - Anthony nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"Let's go out and greet the alien!\" - says David.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Hãy ra ngoài và chào người ngoài hành tinh đó!\" - David nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "In the brown planet there isn't day but only night.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ở hành tinh màu nâu đó không có ban ngày mà chỉ có ban đêm."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"Stars everywhere!\" - exclaims Mary.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Sao ở khắp mọi nơi!\" - Mary reo lên."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"I want to live here!\".",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Tớ muốn sống ở đây!\"."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "But time is over.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhưng đã hết giờ rồi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"We must come back home!",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Chúng ta phải về nhà thôi!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "- says Anthony.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_020.mp3",
        "text_vi": "- Anthony nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They greet the disconsolate alien and then fly away back home.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_021.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Họ chào tạm biệt người ngoài hành tinh buồn bã rồi bay về nhà."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"What a wonderful trip!\" - says Mary.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_022.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Thật là một chuyến đi tuyệt vời!\" - Mary nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"And how beautiful is our Earth!\" - says David.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_138223/s_023.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Và Trái Đất của chúng ta đẹp làm sao!\" - David nói."
      }
    ]
  },
